## 3. Advertising ID
{% if uses_ad_id %}
- **Does your app use advertising ID?** Yes
- Purposes to tick: {{ ("Advertising or marketing, Analytics, Fraud prevention, security, and compliance" if has_ads else "Analytics") }}
