{% endif %}

## 4. Target audience and content
{% if children %}
- Target audience includes children → the app is in the **Families program**. Only use ad SDKs on Google's
  [Families Self-Certified Ads SDK list](https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9900633),
  serve non-personalized ads to children, and keep the privacy policy link in the listing.
{% else %}
- Target audience: choose **13+** age groups only. If the game's art could appeal to children, answer the "appeal to children" question honestly; a neutral age screen may be required.
{% endif %}

