In the form, tick the *collection purposes* under "Why is this user data collected?" and, where Shared = Yes,
the *sharing purposes* under "Why is this user data shared?".
Under Play's rules, data sent to an ad network or attribution provider counts as *shared*; data sent to a
service provider that processes it only for you (Firebase, GameAnalytics, crash reporting) is *collected, not shared*.
